      "section_kind": "volume",
      "volume_candidate": 6,
      "volume_part": "",
      "volume_verified": false,
      "structural_volume_verified": true,
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "九月庚午朔，日有食之。張輔敗賊於太平海口。甲戌，贈北征死事李遠莒國公、王聰漳國公，遂決意親征。丙子，武安侯鄭亨率師巡邊。壬午，成安侯郭亮備禦開平。",
      "boundary_basis": "epub_source_paragraph",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "flags": [],
